1
00:00:00,116 --> 00:00:04,056
(Amy:)The monkey in my tobacco study
has taken to smoking a pipe.

2
00:00:05,288 --> 00:00:07,518
(Amy:)I'm supposed to remove his brain
to examine...

3
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:10,850
(Amy:)...but it's hard, because now
he reminds me of my uncle.

4
00:00:13,429 --> 00:00:16,019
(Amy:)You've been awfully quiet tonight.
Is everything okay?

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,370
(Sheldon:)I'm fine.

6
00:00:18,701 --> 00:00:20,861
(Amy:)All right. Well, how was work today?

7
00:00:21,037 --> 00:00:23,197
(Amy:)Did you exchange your research
with Kripke?

8
00:00:25,074 --> 00:00:26,664
(Sheldon:)Yes.

9
00:00:27,977 --> 00:00:29,447
(Amy:)Sheldon, what's going on?

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:34,580
(Sheldon:)I read his research and...

11
00:00:35,084 --> 00:00:37,884
(Sheldon:)...it's leaps and bounds ahead of mine.

12
00:00:38,054 --> 00:00:42,084
(Sheldon:)Which means the mommy
of the smartest physicist at the university...

13
00:00:42,258 --> 00:00:44,848
(Sheldon:)...is not my mommy as I had thought.

14
00:00:46,396 --> 00:00:48,096
(Sheldon:)It's his mommy.

15
00:00:49,766 --> 00:00:55,026
(Amy:)Sheldon, I wish there was something
I could do to make you feel better.

